// stampSheet, postcard, letterPaper, calendar, chochin, routeMap, stationSign, noren, tanzaku, omikuji, kakejiku, shoji,
// clapper, warningLabel, priceTag, nameTag, stickyNotes, karuta
//
// Techniques:
