/* ================================================================ RULES & TYPE-LIKE TEXTURE */

/* ---- xpRuler \u2014 \u5B9A\u898F\u306E\u76EE\u76DB\u308A: a ruler along the top or bottom edge and one along a side, their tick marks (5s and 10s longer) sliding by; an accent pointer wanders along the horizontal one */
