//              xfQuadRelay xfWiper xfSpiral xfCrossOpen xfClosingHole xfWeave xfPassingWipes xfPrintHead
// B. slices    xfTwoFields xfThreeTier xfStripSort xfEqualizer xfDiagStrips xfRingDial xfStackStrips
