/* ---- xjShadowStay \u2014 \u5F71\u3060\u3051\u6B8B\u308B: the line lifts off the page and its shadow parts from it; the line flies out of the top, the shadow
   (a dimmed copy under it, main pass only) stays a moment longer and fades */
